{
  "episodeId": "CH01_EP04",
  "name": "01.mp3",
  "startNode": "CH01_EP04_N001",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "CH01_EP04_N001",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "MP3屏幕亮起。文件列表里有：01.mp3、02.mp3、summer.mp3、不要删.mp3。",
      "next": "CH01_EP04_N002"
    },
    {
      "id": "CH01_EP04_N002",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "周叙按下了播放。",
      "next": "CH01_EP04_AUDIO_PLAY"
    },
    {
      "id": "CH01_EP04_N003",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "XIA_17_RECORDING",
      "text": "喂？",
      "next": "CH01_EP04_N004"
    },
    {
      "id": "CH01_EP04_N004",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "XIA_17_RECORDING",
      "text": "听得到吗？",
      "next": "CH01_EP04_N005"
    },
    {
      "id": "CH01_EP04_N005",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "XIA_17_RECORDING",
      "text": "周叙。你别装死。",
      "next": "CH01_EP04_N006"
    },
    {
      "id": "CH01_EP04_N006",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "XIA_17_RECORDING",
      "text": "不是你说让我试一下录音功能吗？现在我录了，你又不说话。",
      "next": "CH01_EP04_N007"
    },
    {
      "id": "CH01_EP04_N007",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "XIA_17_RECORDING",
      "text": "等一下。车来了。",
      "next": "CH01_EP04_N008"
    },
    {
      "id": "CH01_EP04_N008",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "雨声从窗外传来，越来越近。",
      "next": "CH01_EP04_MEMORY_TRANSITION"
    },
    {
      "id": "CH01_EP04_N009",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "XIA_17",
      "expression": "curious",
      "position": "center",
      "text": "同学。",
      "next": "CH01_EP04_N010"
    },
    {
      "id": "CH01_EP04_N010",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "ZHOUXU_17",
      "text": "嗯？",
      "next": "CH01_EP04_N011"
    },
    {
      "id": "CH01_EP04_N011",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "XIA_17",
      "text": "你坐里面还是外面？",
      "next": "CH01_EP04_C001"
    },
    {
      "id": "CH01_EP04_C001",
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "里面。",
          "setFlags": [
            "CH01_FIRST_BUS_CHOICE_A"
          ],
          "next": "CH01_EP04_A001"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "外面。",
          "setFlags": [
            "CH01_FIRST_BUS_CHOICE_B"
          ],
          "next": "CH01_EP04_B001"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "随便。",
          "setFlags": [
            "CH01_FIRST_BUS_CHOICE_C"
          ],
          "next": "CH01_EP04_C001A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CH01_EP04_A001",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "XIA_17",
      "text": "那你进去啊。你挡着我，我怎么让。",
      "next": "CH01_EP04_N012"
    },
    {
      "id": "CH01_EP04_B001",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "XIA_17",
      "text": "行。那你一会儿别睡着压我。",
      "next": "CH01_EP04_N012"
    },
    {
      "id": "CH01_EP04_C001A",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "XIA_17",
      "text": "我最烦别人说随便。因为说完随便，最后又都有意见。",
      "next": "CH01_EP04_N012"
    },
    {
      "id": "CH01_EP04_N012",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "XIA_17",
      "text": "你是不是二班的？",
      "next": "CH01_EP04_N013"
    },
    {
      "id": "CH01_EP04_N013",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "ZHOUXU_17",
      "text": "你怎么知道？",
      "next": "CH01_EP04_N014"
    },
    {
      "id": "CH01_EP04_N014",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "XIA_17",
      "expression": "slightSmile",
      "text": "因为我昨天就坐你前面。你不会完全没注意吧？",
      "next": "CH01_EP04_C002"
    },
    {
      "id": "CH01_EP04_C002",
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "真没注意。",
          "next": "CH01_EP04_A002"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "好像有点印象。",
          "next": "CH01_EP04_B002"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "现在注意到了。",
          "effects": {
            "understandingXia": 1
          },
          "next": "CH01_EP04_C002A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CH01_EP04_A002",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "XIA_17",
      "text": "行。非常好。",
      "next": "CH01_EP04_N015"
    },
    {
      "id": "CH01_EP04_B002",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "XIA_17",
      "text": "这句话一听就是没印象。",
      "next": "CH01_EP04_N015"
    },
    {
      "id": "CH01_EP04_C002A",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "XIA_17",
      "text": "你这个人还挺会补救。",
      "next": "CH01_EP04_N015"
    },
    {
      "id": "CH01_EP04_N015",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "那是我第一次真正记住许知夏。至少……我一直以为是第一次。",
      "next": "CH01_EP04_END"
    },
    {
      "id": "CH01_EP04_END",
      "type": "episodeEnd",
      "next": "CH02"
    },
    {
      "id": "CH01_EP04_AUDIO_PLAY",
      "type": "audioInteraction",
      "title": "01.mp3",
      "text": "旧MP3里传出一段带着底噪的录音。",
      "track": "01.mp3",
      "next": "CH01_EP04_N003"
    },
    {
      "id": "CH01_EP04_MEMORY_TRANSITION",
      "type": "transition",
      "title": "回到2007年",
      "text": "2037年的雨声渐渐变成公交车玻璃上的雨声。画面回到2007年9月7日，十七路公交。",
      "yearFrom": 2037,
      "yearTo": 2007,
      "next": "CH01_EP04_N009"
    }
  ]
}
